  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "35733880",
      "title": "Adding Links for Dynamic Routes",
      "sourceHash": "c30484bbf2f62b8c0bbb090718e3ca85ce36fdd8b80edd641c95c89087039ee9",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 3.99,
          "en": "Now to conclude this introduction to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.99,
          "end": 5.568,
          "en": "Dynamic Path segments,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.568,
          "end": 8.73,
          "en": "there is one last thing I want to do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.73,
          "end": 10.92,
          "en": "I want to add some real links here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.92,
          "end": 12.303,
          "en": "to my products page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.38,
          "end": 14.97,
          "en": "For that, we can of course again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.97,
          "end": 19.65,
          "en": "use the link component from 'react-router-dom'.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.65,
          "end": 21.36,
          "en": "And here I'm using link instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.36,
          "end": 24.39,
          "en": "of nav link because I don't wanna highlight those links",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.39,
          "end": 26.443,
          "en": "as being active once they're clicked because",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.443,
          "end": 29.73,
          "en": "we're actually leaving this page when clicking one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.73,
          "end": 31.353,
          "en": "of these links here anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.4,
          "end": 34.95,
          "en": "So the offer here, I'll use the regular link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 34.95,
          "end": 37.92,
          "en": "and wrap that around my products.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 37.92,
          "end": 39.513,
          "en": "So product one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 39.513,
          "end": 42.6,
          "en": "And of course also product two.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 42.6,
          "end": 45.36,
          "en": "And the same for product three.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 45.36,
          "end": 46.593,
          "en": "Like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 47.82,
          "end": 49.71,
          "en": "And then we add the two prop with",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 49.71,
          "end": 51.93,
          "en": "the paths we want navigate to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 51.93,
          "end": 54.18,
          "en": "And here we want to go to slash products,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 54.18,
          "end": 57.033,
          "en": "slash product one, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 57.87,
          "end": 60.75,
          "en": "Here, we want to go to slash products,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 60.75,
          "end": 62.52,
          "en": "slash product two.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 62.52,
          "end": 63.363,
          "en": "And so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 64.23,
          "end": 68.01,
          "en": "Now in reality you would probably fetch the product",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 68.01,
          "end": 70.83,
          "en": "data from some backend, from some database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 70.83,
          "end": 74.64,
          "en": "And therefore you might have your products as an array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 74.64,
          "end": 76.53,
          "en": "which you're getting from your backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 76.53,
          "end": 80.43,
          "en": "Here, I'm hard coding it in this dummy products constant,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 80.43,
          "end": 82.743,
          "en": "but this could be data coming from a backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 83.61,
          "end": 85.74,
          "en": "The data you might be getting might be an array full",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 85.74,
          "end": 87.39,
          "en": "of JavaScript objects,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 87.39,
          "end": 90.48,
          "en": "where every object has an ID and a title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 90.48,
          "end": 92.313,
          "en": "Like, product one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 93.15,
          "end": 95.7,
          "en": "So here I might have free products,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 95.7,
          "end": 97.47,
          "en": "which are fetched from a backend,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 97.47,
          "end": 100.41,
          "en": "which have different IDs and different titles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 100.41,
          "end": 102.72,
          "en": "That's how we might be getting our data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 102.72,
          "end": 105.33,
          "en": "And therefore, in reality, instead of hard coding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 105.33,
          "end": 106.64,
          "en": "our list items like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 106.64,
          "end": 109.251,
          "en": "we might be creating that list dynamically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 109.251,
          "end": 111.72,
          "en": "as you learned it early in the course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 111.72,
          "end": 114.27000000000001,
          "en": "By mapping through all these products.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 114.27000000000001,
          "end": 117.03,
          "en": "And then here we're rendering a list item for",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 117.03,
          "end": 119.64,
          "en": "every product in this array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 119.64,
          "end": 122.31,
          "en": "We add the key, as we should always do,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 122.31,
          "end": 124.29,
          "en": "when creating lists like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 124.29,
          "end": 127.38,
          "en": "And in the list item, we then output our link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 127.38,
          "end": 131.16,
          "en": "Where between the link text, we output the product title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 131.16,
          "end": 133.98,
          "en": "And now the link should be constructed dynamically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 133.98,
          "end": 136.113,
          "en": "The value for the two prop, I mean.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 137.07,
          "end": 140.25,
          "en": "And to do that, we could add a dynamic value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 140.25,
          "end": 143.88,
          "en": "where we construct a string dynamically by using back ticks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 143.88,
          "end": 147.48,
          "en": "So that we build such a JavaScript template literal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 147.48,
          "end": 151.11,
          "en": "which makes it easier to dynamically inject dynamic values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 151.11,
          "end": 153.03,
          "en": "into this string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 153.03,
          "end": 156.177,
          "en": "And then we start with slash products, but thereafter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 156.177,
          "end": 158.19,
          "en": "after this second slash.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 158.19,
          "end": 161.37,
          "en": "We inject a dynamic value into this string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 161.37,
          "end": 164.727,
          "en": "And the dynamic value here could be 'prod.id'.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 166.2,
          "end": 168.63,
          "en": "So now we're generating multiple list items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 168.63,
          "end": 172.38,
          "en": "with different links, which have different paths.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 172.38,
          "end": 174.48,
          "en": "Now, with that, if we save that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 174.48,
          "end": 177.32999999999998,
          "en": "And we go to slash products, we got this list here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 177.32999999999998,
          "end": 179.04,
          "en": "But if we click those different links,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 179.04,
          "end": 181.29,
          "en": "were taken to the product details page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 181.29,
          "end": 183.39,
          "en": "with the different product IDs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 183.39,
          "end": 186.75,
          "en": "Which can also be found here in the URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 186.75,
          "end": 189.813,
          "en": "So, that's how this is connected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 191.04,
          "end": 194.73,
          "en": "Of course, this works for all the products here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 194.73,
          "end": 197.22,
          "en": "So that's how we can generate and build links",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 197.22,
          "end": 200.373,
          "en": "for routes that have dynamic path parameters.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}